      "text": "ManifestEntry\n  source_id · content_type ·\ncontent_hash\n  path · author · datetime\n  linked_executive · linked_project\n\nbytes  — raw item, read-only copy\n\nExtractedText  (in-memory only, never\npersisted)\n  source_id · text ·\nspans[(EvidenceLocation,text)]\n  has_text_layer · printable_ratio\n  image_coverage · coverage_complete ·\nocr_used\n\nFinding  (content-free)\n  source_id · finding_id · category\n  reason_code · reason_text\n  score_type: DETERMINISTIC_MATCH /\n    SIMILARITY / MODEL_SCORE /\nCLASSIFIER_SCORE\n  band? · calibration_status\n  evidence_location{page/sheet/cell/char}\n  detector_version · rule_id? · score?(0-\n100)\n\nInferenceRequest → InferenceResult\n  {source_id, category, span_location,\n   text (repr=False), crosses_boundary}\n  → {score, model_version,\ncalibration_status}\n\nWs1Summary  (ONE output row per item)\n  source_id · snapshot_id · content_type\n  flag_status · sensitivity_categories\n  reason_summary ·\nstrongest_band/type/score\n  calibration_status · processing_status\n  exception_code · content_hash\n  run_id · config_version · metadata",
